  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Aïe, aïe, aïe...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAh, tu tombes bien, m<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿࠈon granda grande !\nPourrais-tu m’aider à trouver quelque chose ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai perdu ma bague dans le Cimetière\nDussommeil... Aïe, aïe...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100690020007000650072006400750020006D0061002000620061006700750065002000640061006E00730020006C0065002000430069006D00650074006900E800720065000A0044007500730073006F006D006D00650069006C002E002E002E0020004100EF0065002C0020006100EF0065002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je me recueillais sur une tombe, quand\nun Pokémon sauvage est sorti de nulle part...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nla surprise m’a fait tomber, et... Ouille, mon dos !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’abord les Pokémon se multiplient en ville,\npuis le cimetière devient une zone sauvage...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\net maintenant, je perds ma bague ! Quelle poisse !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Pokémon qui m’a effrayée était un Ténéfix,\nil me semble.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est un Pokémon qui a pour seul point faible\nle type Fée, alors sois prudent<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe si tu le croises.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 169
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois que j’étais tout au fond du cimetière\nquand j’ai fait tomber ma bague. Je compte<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsur toi, mais fais bien attention, hein !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce Ténéfix semble tenir la bague que Moïra\nvous a demandé de retrouver...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300650020005400E9006E00E9006600690078002000730065006D0062006C0065002000740065006E006900720020006C006100200062006100670075006500200071007500650020004D006F00EF00720061000A0076006F0075007300200061002000640065006D0061006E006400E900200064006500200072006500740072006F0075007600650072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voulez-vous le défier pour la récupérer ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075006C0065007A002D0076006F007500730020006C00650020006400E9006600690065007200200070006F007500720020006C00610020007200E900630075007000E90072006500720020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas maintenant.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100730020006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "TÉNÉ !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400C9004E00C900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Ténéfix est parti en laissant la Bague Souvenirs\nderrière lui.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650020005400E9006E00E9006600690078002000650073007400200070006100720074006900200065006E0020006C00610069007300730061006E00740020006C006100200042006100670075006500200053006F007500760065006E006900720073000A0064006500720072006900E8007200650020006C00750069002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Ténéfix détenait la Bague Souvenirs.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650020005400E9006E00E90066006900780020006400E900740065006E0061006900740020006C006100200042006100670075006500200053006F007500760065006E006900720073002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rapportez-la à sa propriétaire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006100700070006F007200740065007A002D006C0061002000E0002000730061002000700072006F00700072006900E9007400610069007200650020002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, comment avancent tes recherches ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’espère que ma bague ne va pas finir dans\nle ventre d’un de ces Pokémon sauvages...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, mais... c’est ma bague !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006D006100690073002E002E002E0020006320190065007300740020006D00610020006200610067007500650020002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous lui donnez la Bague Souvenirs.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006C0075006900200064006F006E006E0065007A0020006C006100200042006100670075006500200053006F007500760065006E006900720073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, vraiment ? C’est ce Ténéfix qui l’avait ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200076007200610069006D0065006E00740020003F0020004320190065007300740020006300650020005400E9006E00E900660069007800200071007500690020006C2019006100760061006900740020003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est peut-être un Pokémon sauvage,\nmais il a du goût !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200070006500750074002D00EA00740072006500200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200073006100750076006100670065002C000A006D00610069007300200069006C0020006100200064007500200067006F00FB00740020002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je la lui aurais bien laissée, mais il s’agit de mon\nalliance. Je ne peux pas m’en séparer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je te remercie pour ton aide. Tiens, voici\nun petit quelque chose, pour la peine.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je demanderai dans mon testament à ce qu’on\ndépose cette bague sur ma tombe après ma mort.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qui sait ?\nPeut-être que ce Ténéfix viendra la chercher !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750069002000730061006900740020003F000A0050006500750074002D00EA00740072006500200071007500650020006300650020005400E9006E00E90066006900780020007600690065006E0064007200610020006C00610020006300680065007200630068006500720020002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’espère que cela le rendra heureux !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLe bon goût doit être récompensé, même si\nc’est un Pokémon sauvage qui en fait preuve !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’espère que ce Ténéfix veillera sur mon plus\nbeau souvenir. Je ne pourrais rêver mieux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
